    <item>
      <title>How to Integrate Flyway Into Linux Desktop Environment</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/how-to-integrate-flyway-into-linux-desktop-environment/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 18:33:04 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/how-to-integrate-flyway-into-linux-desktop-environment/</guid>
      <description>&lt;img class=&#34;badge&#34;
	src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Flyway-CC0200?logo=flyway&amp;logoColor=FFF&amp;style=flat&#34;
	alt=&#34;Flyway Badge&#34; /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today I decided to ditch Flyway Desktop execution from CLI and integrate into my
Sway + Wofi desktop environment.
Basically, there is what you need:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get an &lt;a href=&#34;https://simpleicons.org/?q=flayway&#34;&gt;Flyway icon&lt;/a&gt; and paste it into &lt;code&gt;flyway.svg&lt;/code&gt; file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Copy that SVG file into
&lt;code&gt;$HOME/.local/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/flyway.svg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Change the color for the icon by adding &lt;code&gt;fill=&amp;quot;#CC0200&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; to the path&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create an &lt;code&gt;$HOME/.local/share/applications/flyway.desktop&lt;/code&gt; file with the
content like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Desktop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Entry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mf&#34;&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Application&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Flyway&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;GenericName&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Database&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;migration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;tool&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Comment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Database&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Migrations&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Made&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Easy&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Categories&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;IDE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Development&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Keywords&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Database&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;IDE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;JDBC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;ODBC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Oracle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;DB2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;MariaDB&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Exec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;HOME&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;share&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;flyway&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;flyway-desktop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;flyway-desktop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;--enable-features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;UseOzonePlatform&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;--ozone-platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;wayland&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;--no-sandbox&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Icon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;flyway&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Terminal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;MimeType&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;sql&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Because Flyway Desktop is Electron app, we are passing few flags to run it on
Wayland system. If you still use Xorg, then just remove those flags.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>2024 Jul 13</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2024-jul-13/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jul 2024 14:21:52 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/2024-jul-13/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;migrating-old-databases&#34;&gt;Migrating old databases&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;



&lt;img class=&#34;badge&#34;
	src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Flyway-CC0200?logo=flyway&amp;logoColor=FFF&amp;style=flat&#34;
	alt=&#34;Flyway Badge&#34; /&gt;





&lt;img class=&#34;badge&#34;
	src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/MariaDB-003545?logo=mariadb&amp;logoColor=FFF&amp;style=flat&#34;
	alt=&#34;MariaDB Badge&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Currently mostly busy with modernizing 15 years old infrastructure of some
customer.
Old and huge MySQL databses. No foreign keys. No timestamps. It&amp;rsquo;s all pretty
convoluted.
Many VM&amp;rsquo;s running directly on KVM without libvirt abstraction. Failing hard
drives. Old PHP. And the overaly of many &amp;ldquo;big brain&amp;rdquo; sysadmins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But at least, I gained full access to the most of the resources, restored
passwords, established secure remote access, etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
